        ],
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## ghost-mastodon-post-one\nShared sub-workflow: takes post_id + source, posts one curated toot to mastodon.social/@criptonautas.\n\n1. Create the Mastodon credential (access token for mastodon.social, scope write:statuses) and select it on **Post Toot**.\n2. **Settings**: model, char limits and the curation prompt live here.\n3. Dedupe + backlog state: data table mastodon_posts. Already-posted ids exit silently at **Not Posted Yet**; unpublished/private posts exit at **Still Published**.",
          "color": 4,
          "width": 816,
          "height": 224
        }
